{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1086173-khaibit-obtenebration","id":1086173,"title":"Khaibit Obtenebration","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-01T06:49:09-07:00","id":1086173,"title":"Khaibit Obtenebration","content":"Hi all, <br /> <br /> Khaibits are so similar to the Lasombra from Masquerade. Does they have the capability to create Shadowy tentacles with their devotions? Maybe with a combination of Pshefk and Tyet? If yes, is there a mechanics for them in order to grab, attack?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T07:12:13-07:00","id":1086181,"title":"","content":"I would certainly allow it (probably with a protean and/or vigor combination) but i think you would need to homebrew mechanics for how it works I'm afraid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12109-urbenmyth","name":"Urbenmyth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"166"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T07:20:21-07:00","id":1086184,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Marcus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1086173-khaibit-obtenebration#post1086173\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Khaibits are so similar to the Lasombra from Masquerade.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really. &quot;Can control shadows&quot; is kind of where their similarities begin and end, and even their respective shadow powers are pretty different.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Marcus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1086173-khaibit-obtenebration#post1086173\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does they have the capability to create Shadowy tentacles with their devotions? Maybe with a combination of Pshefk and Tyet? If yes, is there a mechanics for them in order to grab, attack?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not by RAW. You could probably Homebrew something if you want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T09:38:44-07:00","id":1086227,"title":"","content":"You could create shadowy tentacles with Tyet, but as they would have no physical presence, they would not be grabbing or attacking.<br /> <br /> On the fly, I would go with a new devotion that requires Tyet and Pseshkf, only works within Tyet, 1 vitae to create a tentacle rather than rolling, same cost to improve tentacles, attack or defense pools based on blood potency, bashing damage would be blood potency +1, strength pools also blood potency, and look to Arms of Ahriman for further details. I think that might not be complete nonsense, but I haven't actually tried it out either. I'm not a Masquerade fan, same with respect to tentacles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T21:41:30-07:00","id":1086463,"title":"","content":"You can use obtenneration to control chains cloaked in shadow. Its almost the same?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T23:59:06-07:00","id":1086500,"title":"","content":"Thank you all. I'm not a Masquerade fan too and I prefer Requiem 2ed but I like Lasombra Obtenebration so, reading Khaibit, I just wanted to see if were possible to recreate the tentacles. <br /> <br /> I'd try to homebrew them as suggested by diggs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T00:28:48-07:00","id":1086510,"title":"","content":"What about<b></b>:<br /> <br /> The Shadowy tentacles must be created from Tyet shadows with Pseshkf. <br /> - a tentacles for each vitae spent<br /> - they have Vigor? Blood potency? strenght <br /> - their attack pool is Vigor/blood potency + obfuscate? For grab a +2 due to the fact that a tentacles is well designed for grabbing. <br /> - whitin the scene the tentacles can be powered up with blood as for the kindred physical intensity? Or each vitae a increases the size of 2 meters? <br /> - As for Pseshkf, which must be used, they deal + BP lethal damages to immaterial being? <br /> They act on the vampire will reflexively or as an istant action? (I mean: should the Khaibit lose her action to control them or not?) <br /> <br /> What do you think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7079,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","user":"Marcus","date":". 05-02-2017, 03:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T05:07:26-07:00","id":1086557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Marcus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1086173-khaibit-obtenebration?p=1086510#post1086510\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about<b></b>:<br /> <br /> The Shadowy tentacles must be created from Tyet shadows with Pseshkf.<br /> - a tentacles for each vitae spent<br /> - they have Vigor? Blood potency? strenght<br /> - their attack pool is Vigor/blood potency + obfuscate? For grab a +2 due to the fact that a tentacles is well designed for grabbing.<br /> - whitin the scene the tentacles can be powered up with blood as for the kindred physical intensity? Or each vitae a increases the size of 2 meters?<br /> - As for Pseshkf, which must be used, they deal + BP lethal damages to immaterial being?<br /> They act on the vampire will reflexively or as an istant action? (I mean: should the Khaibit lose her action to control them or not?)<br /> <br /> What do you think?</div> </div> </div> </div>1. Sounds fine.<br /> 2. I'd say Vigor as Strength, since Vigor is the &quot;strength power&quot; and BP is doing other things (as listed below).<br /> 3. Vigor + Brawl? They are being directed, so close combat knowledge seems like it would some into play.<br /> 4. Sounds fine for the first one. Not sure about the second.<br /> 5. Sounds fair.<br /> 6. I'd say they take an instant action to direct, but if they are already grappling, you don't need to continue to focus on them. And/or you can spend an instant action to direct <i>all</i> of your tentacles at once (rather than only directing one at a time). This rewards creating a mob of tentacles, at the cost of a lot of Vitae.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T14:32:11-07:00","id":1086796,"title":"","content":"Personally, I actually would just go with Pseshkf covered chains or whips/ropes, so I would tend to view this as a devotion to use Tyet and Pseshkf on a magically created chain or rope that we are saying has the form of a tentacle, or not perhaps. Use Tyet and Pseshkf and this devotion to create your shadow chains/tentacles coated as a Pseshkf weapon controlled with Tyet. Now that I think about it there is no reason to increase the size of the tentacles because it would be limited to the range of Tyet anyway and they would appear or move anywhere with that range. <br /> <br /> The version I read said the vampire needed to concentrate when controlling and all the tentacles would take the same action. I think that makes it an instant action to control an individual tentacle or multiple tentacles against the same target or multiple tentacles already grappling different targets. Maybe after a few turns a handful of people are being grappled by tentacles. Tentacles squeeze seems like a reasonable single control action.<br /> <br /> Spend vitae on Tyet to cover the entire range of combat. Spend vitae to create tentacles. Spend vitae to coat tentacles with Psehskf. Possibly spend more vitae to improve tentacles. After burning all that vitae at once, I think it would be fair to say you get to do some crazy shit.<br /> <br /> For simplicity, I actually think I might prefer to consider the devotion to use one vitae along with Tyet and Pseshkf on each tentacle to create a Pseshkf coated chain (tentacle appearance) with a grapple bonus controlled with Tyet using the Khaibit's stats to dish out the evil. The other way seems fine too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}